Package: cloudflarer
Title: Interface to the 'Cloudflare' API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Athanasia Mo", "Mowinckel", , "a.m.mowinckel@psykologi.uio.no",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5756-0223"))
Description: An 'R' interface to the 'Cloudflare' REST API
    (<https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/>). Wraps the v4 API with
    authenticated requests, response unwrapping, paginated list helpers,
    and a generic request function so users can call any endpoint that is
    not yet covered by a dedicated wrapper.
